-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 2, §2.11 גננת בחטיבה צעירה
-- A kindergarten teacher in a young division attached to a first or second
-- grade: the rate of her education allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `2.11 גננת בחטיבה צעירה`

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2 The section's title line.
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2/p1 An amendment note: updated 21.7.02.

DECLARE `attached grade` IS ONE OF `first grade`, `second grade`, `no attached grade`

-- 1-2: the education allowance is 11.5% for a teacher attached to a first
-- grade and 10% for one attached to a second. The text does not name the
-- base; section 1.12 sets the class-education allowance as a share of the
-- combined salary, which is read as the base here (an input).
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_1
GIVEN g IS AN `attached grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `young-division education allowance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `first grade` THEN 0.115
    @ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_2
    WHEN `second grade` THEN 0.10
    WHEN `no attached grade` THEN 0

@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_2/p2
`month the rates apply from` MEANS 2001 TIMES 12 PLUS 9

@export default The monthly education allowance of a young-division kindergarten teacher under section 2.11 of the takanon
GIVEN g IS AN `attached grade` @desc the grade her kindergarten is attached to
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc her combined salary (השכר המשולב), the base section 1.12 uses; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `young-division education allowance` g `combined salary` IS
    `combined salary` TIMES `young-division education allowance rate` g

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_3__para_1 A source: joint decision of the Ministries of Education and Finance of 6.3.01; special collective agreement of 10.7.02.

-- Worked examples; the salary of 10,000 is a placeholder.
#ASSERT `young-division education allowance` `first grade` 10000 EQUALS 1150
#ASSERT `young-division education allowance` `second grade` 10000 EQUALS 1000
